# Copy to db/multi_source_demo.env (git-ignored) and fill in.
#
# Connection string for the SECOND Neon project standing in for "Core Banking System"
# (specs/multi-source-reconciliation.md, specs/multi-source-ingestion-adf.md).
# This is NOT the app's own database (that's backend/.env's DATABASE_URL) - create a separate
